@startuml
title Вариант 2 - Failover (push упал -> SMS)

participant "Temporal" as Temporal
participant "Воркер" as Worker
participant "Push Адаптер" as PushAdapter
participant "SMS Адаптер" as SmsAdapter

Temporal -> Worker: Задача (шаг push)
Worker -> PushAdapter: send_push()
PushAdapter --> Worker: Ошибка
Worker -> Temporal: Шаг упал

note right of Temporal: Temporal сам делает retry.\nЕсли не вышло - переходим на SMS.

Temporal -> Worker: Задача (шаг sms)
Worker -> SmsAdapter: send_sms()
SmsAdapter --> Worker: Успех
Worker -> Temporal: Шаг завершен
@enduml